nodes.body:
> Just ran into this while testing across 2 h200s. Are project maintainers aware of this issue and what is the timeline for getting this into a release?

@merrymercy could you please help add the run-ci label so the registered 2-GPU test can execute? 
@ShangmingCai could you please help review the PD-disaggregation change or route it to the appropriate reviewer? 

This PR has been open for 17 days, remains mergeable, and has not received any review yet. The current diff is limited to the missing DFlash PD dispatch and its registered accuracy test; the current source has also passed a local 4P+4D Mooncake/RDMA smoke test, and another user reproduced the missing behavior on 2×H200. Please let me know if any additional change or validation is required.

